1. Content Creator Exception:
Notwithstanding the NonCommercial restriction of the CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license,
the copyright holder explicitly grants permission to any individual or entity to
create, stream, upload, and monetize video content, audio content, live streams,
and screenshots featuring or demonstrating this software (including, but not limited
