YouTube, Twitch, and TikTok) without purchasing a separate commercial license.

2. Modpack & Launcher Exception:
Notwithstanding the NonCommercial restriction of CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, permission is
explicitly granted for this software to be included in public or private modpacks,
and to be indexed, downloaded, and installed by third-party Minecraft launchers
(including, but not limited to, CurseForge App, Modrinth App, Prism Launcher, ATLauncher,
MultiMC, GDLauncher and Server Hosting Panels), provided that:
  a) Downloads are pulled directly from official repositories or authorized APIs
     (such as Modrinth, CurseForge, or GitHub Releases).
  b) The modpack or launcher is not distributed behind a direct monetary paywall
     (e.g., selling access to the mod or modpack for real-world currency).
  c) Platform-standard ad revenue, subscription models, or creator reward programs
     provided by official platforms (e.g., CurseForge Rewards Program, Modrinth Creator
     Program) shall NOT be considered a violation of the NonCommercial restriction.

All other NonCommercial and ShareAlike terms of CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 remain in full effect.


